            "name": "Provides jwks.json containing metadata to validate token signature.",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns signature keys for verifying authenticity of OAUTH2 tokens issued by Basware API. This endpoint is used by Basware to validate tokens passed by API clients in API operation requests using OAUTH2 authentication. It is good practice for the oauth2 tokens (from 'tokens' API) to be validated also by the API client.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
